# PUSH PRESS

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Push Press is an explosive whole-body exercise designed to develop power through coordinated triple extension and upper-body force transmission.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the foundational power exercises for combat athletes.

---

# Philosophy

The Push Press teaches athletes to generate force from the ground and transfer it efficiently through the kinetic chain.

Unlike the Strict Press, lower-body contribution is intentional and essential.

CAS selects the Push Press whenever explosive whole-body power is a primary objective.

