# Final Principle

The Push Press is not simply an overhead lift.

It teaches the athlete to create explosive force,

transfer it efficiently through the kinetic chain,

and express it with speed and precision.

For combat athletes,

it is one of the highest-value power exercises in the CAS knowledge base.